---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/nav/Breadcrumb.astro';

const updated = 'January 1, 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | MazeThis"
  description="MazeThis privacy policy — how we handle your data, what we collect, and your rights."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">
    <Breadcrumb crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />

    <div class="mt-4 mb-8">
      <h1 class="mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-h2:text-xl prose-h2:mt-8 prose-h2:mb-3 prose-p:text-slate-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-ul:text-slate-600 prose-li:mb-1">

      <p>
        MazeThis ("we," "us," or "our") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy
        explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights with respect to that information.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>MazeThis is a static website. We do not require accounts or sign-ups. The information we collect is limited to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage analytics:</strong> We may collect anonymized data about pages visited, browser type,
          and general geographic region (country-level) to understand how the site is used and improve it.
          No personally identifiable information is collected for this purpose.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Local storage:</strong> MazeThis uses your browser's local storage to save your preferences
          (such as dark mode preference) and game state (such as personal best times). This data never
          leaves your device and is not transmitted to our servers.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Server logs:</strong> Our hosting provider (Netlify) automatically records standard server
          access logs (IP address, timestamp, URL requested). These are used for security, diagnostics,
          and uptime monitoring. We do not use these logs for marketing or tracking.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        MazeThis does not use tracking cookies or third-party advertising cookies. We may use
        a single session cookie to support site functionality. No cross-site tracking occurs.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We may use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Netlify</strong> (hosting): Processes server requests. Subject to Netlify's own privacy policy.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not use Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, or any advertising networks.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        MazeThis is intended to be safe for all ages, including children. We do not knowingly collect
        personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal
        information, please contact us and we will promptly delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
      <p>
        Because we collect minimal data and no personally identifiable information, there is no personal
        data to delete. Data stored in your browser's local storage can be cleared at any time through
        your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to know what data we hold about you, to request deletion, and to opt out
        of any analytics collection. Since we collect only anonymized usage data, there is no
        personally identifiable information to request or delete.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will update the "Last updated" date
        at the top of this page when we do so. Continued use of MazeThis after changes constitutes
        acceptance of the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please visit our
        <a href="/about">About page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
